        "Content": "CITYWIDE present Apt 47, Steevens Gate, an exciting opportunity to purchase a bright & exceptionally spacious, 3rd floor, 2x bedroom / 2x bathroom apartment, ideally positioned on James Street in the heart of Dublin 8.\n\nThis apartment comprises of an entrance hallway, spacious open plan living / dining area, with stylish kitchen to the side, two great size double bedrooms, primary with an ensuite and bathroom, some always welcome additional storage space is provided off the hallway too. \nOn entering this apartment, the hallway leads you through to the open plan living space, with large south-facing windows and the 3rd floor view onto the greenery of the Obelisk fountain and sundial, this a bright and airy space.\nThe kitchen is located to the side of the open plan space off the living area, and is stylishly presented with white gloss fitted cabinets, a matching white tile splashback and contrasting dark countertop. High quality integrated appliances, including an integrated microwave, complete the sleek look of the kitchen.\n\nBoth bedrooms are great size double rooms and boast the same south-facing orientation as the living area, with an abundance of natural light throughout the day. Fitted wardrobes provide ample storage space and there is plenty of space in both rooms for additional bedroom furniture and work-from-home areas.\nOff the primary bedroom is a fully tiled ensuite, with bath and modern suite fitted.\nThe main bathroom off the hallway also fully tiled, with a bath and modern suite fitted.\nAlso off the hallway is a convenient storage space.\n\nThe flooring throughout the apartment is a wood laminate, creating a nice flow and continuity through the rooms, with practical tile floor in the kitchen, bathroom and ensuite. \nThe heating throughout the apartment is updated electric and all windows are timber double glazed.\nThe apartment has an enviable B energy rating, indicating a strong energy efficiency and making the property Green Mortgage (lower interest rate) applicable.\nThe development has fob / code access security doors and gates, all with intercoms throughout the entrance, common areas.\nOne carparking space in the secure underground carpark is assigned to this apartment.\n\nManagement Company Fee: \nService Charge: 3,502.53 per annum \n(+ Building Investment Fund: 2,422.14 per annum)\n\nFLOOR AREAS\nOPEN PLAN AREA\nDINING AREA 3.03m x 3.13m\nLIVING AREA 3.61m x 3.42m \nKITCHEN 2.56m x 3.13m\n\nPRIMARY BEDROOM 6.83m x 3.22m\nENSUITE 1.91m x 2.52m\nBEDROOM TWO 5.69m x 2.91m\nBATHROOM 3.04m x 1.98m\n+ HALLWAY \n+ STORAGE ROOM\n\nTOTAL FLOOR AREA 92m2 (990 sq ft)\n\nLOCATION\nLocated in the mature residential development of Steevens Gate, on James Street in the heart of Dublin 8, an exciting south city location offering an array of excellent food, social and entertainment options on your door step while being only a short stroll to the City Centre, St. Stephens Green / Grafton St / Camden St areas.\nLocal favourites such as the Lucky`s, Spitalfields, and Fumbally Café, are in close proximity, as well as a range of bars, cafes and restaurants that have recently opened in the surrounding area.\nA variety of supermarkets, including LIDL are neighbouring on Thomas St, gyms and other amenities are close by.\nThe Irish Museum of Modern Art and the War Memorial Gardens at Kilmainham are a short stroll away, offer great walking / running / cycling routes.\nThe location boasts excellent connectivity too, James`s LUAS Red Line Stop is 5mins away, linking with Heuston and Connolly Train Stations, as well as the IFSC and Docklands area.\nThe new National Childrens Hospital and St James`s Hospitals are a 15min walk from the property, while numerous Universities / Colleges are in close proximity, including NCAD, Trinity College, RCSI and TU Dublin.\n\nTHIS IS AN OPPORTUNITY NOT TO BE MISSED, VIEWINGS ARE HIGHLY RECCOMENDED & VIA CITYWIDE\n\n(These particulars do not constitute an offer or contract, and whilst every effort has been made in preparing all descriptions, dimensions, maps, and plans, these details should not be relied upon as fact. Dimensions / Illustrations are for guideline purposes only and not to scale. CITYWIDE will not hold itself responsible for any inaccuracies contained therein.)\n\n"
      },
